          "sender_id": "juror-1",
          "sequence": 8
        },
        {
          "content": "Challenger closing note. Episode settled EXPIRED_UNCHALLENGED with no challenge and no evidence filed by me. Settlement record: creator refund 1000000, no forfeited bonds, no juror payouts, no protocol fee; my own deposited principal was zero, so my net payoff on this case is 0. My reason for not challenging stands as stated at sequence 3: the signed ledger's itemised lines reconcile exactly to its stated totals (received 6+5+6 = 17; dispatched 8+5+6+4 = 23, a 6-unit net outflow), so the claim was supported on the evidence and there was no contrary evidence for me to post. I record the same scope limits the jurors noted: the ledger evidences the direction of net movement only, not opening or closing stock, and its completeness rests on its own assertion. I filed no challenge and made no arrangement with any party or juror about this outcome.",
          "content_hash": "0xf3793fd0f488d8ec54835b9ab469fc7f30db647934f4463d1e8fd1a8f39b43fe",
