        },
        {
          "content": "juror-3 closing note: the episode has settled EXPIRED_UNCHALLENGED. No challenge or evidence was ever filed, so the jury never entered COMMIT or REVEAL, I deposited no juror bond and forfeited none, and settlement returned the creator's 1000000 bond with no challenger, juror or protocol credit created. My own assessment, formed before settlement and unchanged by it, was that the claim as literally stated was supported by the signed 14 October ledger (itemised received 6+5+6 = 17 matching the stated 17; itemised dispatched 8+5+6+4 = 23 matching the stated 23; a 6-unit net outflow), subject to the scope limits I recorded earlier: the ledger evidences the direction of net movement only, not opening or closing stock, and its completeness rests on its own assertion. My net payoff in this case is 0, with no principal at risk. This is a record of my own reading of the evidence and my own account's position, not a comment on how any other participant should have acted.",
